# Ultimate rules, verified 2026-09-25: https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/spellcrafting
Spellcrafting	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:General.IncanterBonus	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Spheres Casting Core	DESC:Permits researching custom spells. Each definition must be reviewed by the GM; research time and the final Spellcraft check are resolved before recording acquisition.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/spellcrafting
Spellbook Mastery	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:General.IncanterBonus	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Spheres Casting Core	PREFEAT:1,Spellcrafting	DESC:Permits casting deciphered spells directly from a spellbook. Add one round to casting time. Each missing sphere or talent adds 10 percent mishap chance; missing advanced talents prohibit use. Spellbook casting is not automated by the repertoire records.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/spellcrafting